{"v":4,"catch":"一個開發者被困在視訊遊戲中的故事？","desc":"你扮演Ethan，他在一家小型視訊遊戲開發公司的辦公室工作，試圖養活他懷孕的妻子。對Ethan來說，這只是正常的一周：起床，上班，回家，上床睡覺，日復一日地重複。但隨後，奇怪的事情發生了。Ethan在半夜接到一個不尋常的電話，不知何故被傳送到另一個維度。 Ethan 必須完成一些不尋常的試驗並嘗試回到現實世界。","publisher":"Sometimes You","release":"2022-05-12","genres":["冒險","街機","射擊","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ef4ce62c9dd64d1ce1d550e67f5003d34c9ee582e89dfdf26aea194560316b5c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3c12e604441fe963ca2f8b126b3be1b1b3d06b113b96fd866a0d4b670a0787b8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4d7682e5106d3d2a93be30935d9c7324c8f4b83d4450754bfd25ac1c49ba1d18.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/84977e192e030f0b85b50b3ada3707e9269f758700a2f083dffb9f9c6c0e7e59.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0ea5d6ba744e4f95f3692bb4b1b04b8eb9037ac2d887eedfa4b1ec502ff8a395.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/36cfa270bff9f8f07cfea44d1732dc5b23c0702ba27a3e715091e5a941ca16ff.jpg"],"titleId":"0100920016e24000","dlc":[]}